WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:04,630
Don't move

2
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:06,430
I also know a little bit about the laws

3
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:09,410
Master Ma

4
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:11,010
Admire for a long time

5
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:19,420
Your room is too cold

6
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,020
is it possible

7
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,220
There is a female ghost sitting next to you now

8
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,420
Don’t do bad things and don’t be afraid of ghosts knocking on your door

9
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,220
No, a ghost is coming

10
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:33,700
Dad save me

11
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,930
You are illegally detaining me

12
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,730
The door is right there. I won't let you go.

13
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:39,130
Let me explain this first

14
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:41,130
It’s time to pay back the luck you borrowed from Zhao Yuxuan, right?

15
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:43,330
Borrow luck. What kind of luck should you borrow?

16
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:46,390
Even if I borrow it, what can you do?

17
00:00:46,590 --> 00:00:48,790
This trick is broken, I have another trick

18
00:00:48,990 --> 00:00:57,420
Net flowers

19
00:00:57,820 --> 00:01:04,150
she's coming

20
00:01:04,350 --> 00:01:06,750
I didn't fight enough. I'm angry.

21
00:01:06,750 --> 00:01:08,950
I don’t know how long those evil spirits have been in my wife.

22
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:10,750
The resentment is overwhelming and strange.

23
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:12,350
They will definitely report to you in the future

24
00:01:12,350 --> 00:01:14,350
You destroyed my cultivation and lost my wife.

25
00:01:14,550 --> 00:01:15,750
But I am a Taoist priest

26
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:17,640
Let her tell the fortune of Pifa

27
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:20,040
I can probably tell which faction you are from just by looking at your hands.

28
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:21,640
I will report it to your ancestor

29
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,240
Let her punish you

30
00:01:27,830 --> 00:01:29,230
What did you do with this?

31
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:31,430
This is the soul imprisoned in the dog drum

32
00:01:31,630 --> 00:01:33,830
If I like it, I’ll release it.

33
00:01:34,830 --> 00:01:36,230
If she likes it, let her follow.

34
00:01:36,230 --> 00:01:38,230
This dog doesn’t eat dog food anyway.
